<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include("CommonModules/Head", { title: null }) %>
</head>
<body class="landing">
    <%- include("CommonModules/Nav", { active: "home" }) %>

    <main>
        <section class="container hero">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow">Study log for university students</p>
                <h1>See how your study habits shape your grades.</h1>
                <p class="lead">Log each study session per course, then look back at when you studied, how long, and how it went.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <% if (activeSession) { %>
                        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/app">Go to my courses</a>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/register">Create account</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-lg" href="/login">Log in</a>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>

            <figure class="card hero-figure" aria-label="Example chart of study hours per week">
                <div class="card-head">
                    <strong>Linear Algebra</strong>
                    <span class="subtle">Hours per week</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mini-bars" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div style="height: 30%"></div>
                    <div style="height: 45%"></div>
                    <div style="height: 38%"></div>
                    <div style="height: 62%"></div>
                    <div style="height: 55%"></div>
                    <div style="height: 80%"></div>
                    <div style="height: 92%"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mini-labels" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span>w36</span><span>w37</span><span>w38</span><span>w39</span><span>w40</span><span>w41</span><span>w42</span>
                </div>
                <figcaption class="subtle">Example data</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </section>

        <section class="features">
            <div class="container features-grid">
                <div class="feature">
                    <span class="feature-index">01</span>
                    <h2>What it is</h2>
                    <p>A simple log of your study sessions. Add the time, type of study and how it felt, and EduTrack builds the overview for you.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <span class="feature-index">02</span>
                    <h2>For students</h2>
                    <p>Spot which routines work before the exam, not after. Compare weeks, study types and how rested you were.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <span class="feature-index">03</span>
                    <h2>For universities</h2>
                    <p>Course-level patterns help teachers see where students struggle and improve course design and student support.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include("CommonModules/Footer") %>
</body>
</html>
